This project builds and runs extensions from keiyoushi/extensions-source
(https://github.com/keiyoushi/extensions-source) as its subject under test. keiyoushi-monitor is
not affiliated with, and is not endorsed by, the keiyoushi project.

Some checks are adapted from vetleledaal/keiyoushi-status
(https://github.com/vetleledaal/keiyoushi-status), used with permission.

== Mihon-derived files ==

The JVM harness at harness/runtime/ stands in for the Mihon/Komikku app so that a keiyoushi
extension can run and be smoke-tested outside the app. Some files under
harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ are ported, with only ext-run-specific
changes (each marked "ext-run:" in the file itself), from Mihon
(https://github.com/mihonapp/mihon), licensed Apache License, Version 2.0. Each such file carries
its own header naming the exact upstream path and commit it was ported from. As of this writing,
those files are:

  harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/AndroidCookieJar.kt
  harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/NetworkHelper.kt
  harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/NetworkPreferences.kt
  harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/OkHttpExtensions.kt
  harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/interceptor/CloudflareInterceptor.kt
  harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/interceptor/UncaughtExceptionInterceptor.kt
  harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/interceptor/UserAgentInterceptor.kt
  harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/network/interceptor/WebViewInterceptor.kt

Copyright the Mihon Open Source Project and the Tachiyomi Open Source Project, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Other files under harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/ and
harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/android/, androidx/, and app/cash/quickjs/ are NOT derived from
Mihon's code. They are stand-ins written from scratch for this project, matching the shape of
the Android SDK classes (android.*, androidx.*), the extensions-lib API surface that an
extension itself targets (eu.kanade.tachiyomi.source.*, network.Requests,
network.JavaScriptEngine, network.HttpException), and the Cash App QuickJS JVM binding
(app.cash.quickjs) that the harness runs in-process instead of on a device — enough of their
public surface to let a real, unmodified extension's own code run and compile against it, not a
reimplementation of any Mihon or Android internals.

Files under harness/runtime/src/main/kotlin/keiyoushi/extrun/ are original to this project.
